import Tengoku
import Tengoku.Seed.GroupTheory.QuotientGroup.Basic

/-! Tengoku: the imports are the original's, in the tree's names (the umbrella `Tengoku` made names ambiguous). -/

/-!
# The codimension-one Chow group of an integral scheme

For an integral locally Noetherian scheme, codimension-one rational equivalence is generated by
principal Weil divisors.  This file constructs the actual quotient group.  It is the first
geometric Chow group needed by the higher-dimensional Riemann--Roch tracks; no intersection
product is asserted here.
-/

noncomputable section

open AlgebraicGeometry Order

universe u

namespace AlgebraicGeometry.Chow

variable (X : Scheme.{u})

variable [IsIntegral X] [IsLocallyNoetherian X]

end AlgebraicGeometry.Chow
